    <!--
      HOW TO ADD A NEW RELEASE:

      Run the release CLI - it does everything (archive, notarize, staple,
      DMG, Sparkle signature, GitHub release, and this appcast):

        go run ./cmd/boop-release -build -yes \
          -set-version 0.1.1 -set-build 2 \
          -notes "First note
        Second note"

      CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION must increase every release or Sparkle will not
      offer the update. New <item> entries are prepended below this comment.
    -->

